^{:go/end 305} (go/method ^:go/nosplit varint "varint appends v to buf in little-endian-base-128 encoding.\n\nnosplit because it's part of writing an event for an M, which must not\nhave any stack growth.\n" [^{:tag (* traceBuf)} buf ^uint64 v]
